<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 5/6.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 5/6.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Friday, June 6 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   06.06.97	  05.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5276	    6.5372</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3190	    2.3098</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5266	    4.5078</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4496	    3.4364</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5163	    0.5147</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7725	    0.7710</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2899	    0.2887</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9985	    6.9881</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6937	    0.6926	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2403	    1.2397</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
